OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of illegal ghost plates
OL,4,Aon cars revealed by new cameras
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of illegal registration
OL,7,Fplates on cars and other vehicles have
OL,8,Fbeen detected by a new camera system
OL,9,Fcurrently being tested on motorways in
OL,10,Fsouth-east England, BBC Panorama can
OL,11,Freveal.
OL,13,FThese plates have been adapted to avoid
OL,14,Ftheir details being identified by
OL,15,Fautomatic number plate recognition
OL,16,F(ANPR) systems, which are used to
OL,17,Fenforce speed limits and low emission
OL,18,Fzones as well as to track criminals.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
